.idea/

# 内置资源只跟踪「技能」与技能自带 scripts：插件运行时目录与 mcps/ 属于宿主资源
# （约 70MB），本插件不读，不该进仓库与发布包。
builtin/*/mcps/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/dist/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/bin/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/prebuilds/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/core/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/agents/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/hooks/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/mcp/
builtin/*/builtin-plugins/*/node_modules/
